   "hub_id": 14044,
   "version": "1.1.7",
   "description": "<p>Updated for SPT 3.11</p>\n<ul>\n<li>I had to remove A LOT of bugged items due to BSG adding a lot of new scripts and animations to weapons and gear. All weapon presets are now gone. All black vests are also removed. This is because they added too many new animations and scripts in the asset bundles, which we can’t update yet due to an outdated SPT SDK. It’s still possible but it would take me around 300 hours. Not doing that.</li>\n<li>If you want the best experience of my customization mods, you have to stay on SPT 3.10 or older.</li>\n<li>Only weapon attachments and some gear items are now included in BlackCore 1.1.7.</li>\n</ul>\n",
